---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Wayline from '../components/Wayline.astro';
---

<Layout title="Start Here — Don't Lose Your Way" description="You are not the only one. A quiet space for reflection. Not therapy. Not a fix. Just proof that others have stood where you stand.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>Start Here</h1>
      <p>You are not the only one.</p>
      <p>A quiet space for reflection.</p>
      <p>Not therapy. Not a fix.</p>
      <p>Just proof that others have stood where you stand.</p>

      <div class="video-wrap">
        <video controls preload="metadata" src="/video/dont-lose-your-way-captioned.mp4" aria-label="Don't Lose Your Way — a short introduction in Carlos's own voice">
          Your browser does not support the video element.
        </video>
      </div>

      <h2>The Beginning</h2>
      <p>I wrote a letter I hoped no one would ever have to read.</p>
      <p>I'm still here. And if you're reading this, you are too.</p>
      <p>This isn't a success story. It's a place to feel less alone.</p>
      <p><a href="/about">Read the full story →</a></p>
      <p>This space exists for people who almost gave up — and stayed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Start with my story</h2>
      <p>Two listens from the <em>Healing Trauma Through AI Music</em> series — the short intro first, then the episode it opens.</p>

      <h3 class="listen-title">Ep. 6 Intro: This Is My Story</h3>
      <div class="embed-wrap">
        <iframe title="Healing Trauma Through AI Music — Ep. 6 Intro: This Is My Story on SoundCloud" width="100%" height="166" scrolling="no" frameborder="no" loading="lazy" allow="autoplay" src="https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//soundcloud.com/carlos-cabrales-iii/healing-trauma-through-ai-2&color=%23cf2e4f&auto_play=false&hide_related=true&show_comments=false&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=false"></iframe>
      </div>

      <h3 class="listen-title">Ep. 6: My Unspoken Journey</h3>
      <div class="embed-wrap">
        <iframe title="Healing Trauma Through AI Music — Ep. 6: My Unspoken Journey on SoundCloud" width="100%" height="166" scrolling="no" frameborder="no" loading="lazy" allow="autoplay" src="https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//soundcloud.com/carlos-cabrales-iii/the-weight-of-inherited&color=%23cf2e4f&auto_play=false&hide_related=true&show_comments=false&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=false"></iframe>
      </div>
      <p><a href="https://soundcloud.com/carlos-cabrales-iii/sets/healing-trauma-through-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The full series on SoundCloud →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Stay a little longer</h2>
      <ul class="doors">
        <li><a href="/about">Read the story</a> — the moment this place began.</li>
        <li><a href="/podcast">Listen</a> — documentary-style stories for those who carry weight no one sees.</li>
        <li><a href="/chapel">The Chapel</a> — leave an anonymous reflection and read others who have stood here. (The lyric-making Chapel is still being built.)</li>
        <li><a href="/journal">Journal</a> — reflections for the nights you feel alone.</li>
        <li><a href="/resources">Resources</a> — grounding tools and support for right now, and for tonight.</li>
      </ul>
      <Wayline />

      <h2>The music that came from this place</h2>
      <div class="embed-wrap">
        <iframe title="Healing Trauma Through AI Music series on SoundCloud" width="100%" height="300" scrolling="no" frameborder="no" loading="lazy" allow="autoplay" src="https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/playlists/2334756882&color=%23cf2e4f&auto_play=false&hide_related=true&show_comments=false&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=false"></iframe>
      </div>
      <p><a href="https://soundcloud.com/carlos-cabrales-iii/sets/healing-trauma-through-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Listen on SoundCloud →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .section-alt { background: var(--surface); }
    .video-wrap { margin: 2rem 0; }
    .video-wrap video { width: 100%; max-width: 24rem; display: block; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: #000; }
    .prose .doors { list-style: none; padding-left: 0; }
    .prose .doors li {
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-strong-bg);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    }
    .prose .doors a { font-weight: 600; }
    .listen-title { margin-top: 1.75rem; }
    .embed-wrap { margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); overflow: hidden; }
    .embed-wrap iframe { display: block; border: 0; }
    .wayline { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  </style>
</Layout>
